{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>In their land you shall have no inheritance.</b> Our Rabbis of blessed memory interpreted: ״בארצם לא תנחל״ — at the time of the division of the Land. <br><b>And you shall have no portion among them.</b> In the spoil. <br><b>I am your portion.</b> From My table you eat. That is, that he merits sustenance from the supernal table through those ordinances that the Torah merited for him."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:33:48.849651254Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}